#: ../../source/installation/running.rst:340
msgid "Restart Apache."
msgstr "Apache를 재시작하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/running.rst:293
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "테스트"

#: ../../source/installation/running.rst:295
msgid ""
"With the above configuration, your webapp would be accessed with the URL "
"**http://myproject.local/** in your browser."
msgstr ""
"위의 설정으로 브라우저에서 **http://myproject.local/** URL로 웹 앱에 접근할 수 있습니다."

